ant claims against reliable sources. Neutral point of view means the article should present information fairly, without promotional language or advocacy.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"No original research is also important. A business article should summarize what reliable published sources say, not introduce new claims, interpretations, or marketing narratives that lack independent support.\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"No original research is also important. A business article should summarize what reliable published sources say, not introduce new claims, interpretations, or marketing narratives that lack independent support.\\\"}]]}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"section\\\",\\\"company-notability\\\",{\\\"id\\\":\\\"company-notability\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"mb-10 scroll-mt-28\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-navy md:text-3xl\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Understand company notability expectations\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-base leading-8 text-muted\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"For organizations and companies, notability is commonly established through significant coverage in reliable, independent secondary sources. Routine database listings, press releases, self-published profiles, and paid content are usually not enough by themselves.\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"For organizations and companies, notability is commonly established through significant coverage in reliable, independent secondary sources. Routine database listings, press releases, self-published profiles, and paid content are usually not enough by themselves.\\\"}],\\\"$L32\\\"]}]]}],\\\"$L33\\\",\\\"$L34\\\"],\\\"$L35\\\",\\\"$L36\\\",\\\"$L37\\\"]}]]}]}]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"38:I[28792,[\\\"$13\\\",\\\"$1f\\\"],\\\"FAQ\\\"]\\n39:I[5014,[\\\"$13\\\",\\\"$1f\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n32:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"Before drafting, businesses should assess whether coverage is substantial, independent, and focused on the company. Topic-specific notability guidance can help, but each case still depends on the quality and context of available sources.\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Before drafting, businesses should assess whether coverage is substantial, independent, and focused on the company. Topic-specific notability guidance can help, but each case still depends on the quality and context of available sources.\\\"}]\\n33:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"section\\\",\\\"writing-standards\\\",{\\\"id\\\":\\\"writing-standards\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"mb-10 scroll-mt-28\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-navy md:text-3xl\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Write in an encyclopedic style\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-base leading-8 text-muted\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"Business articles should use clear, factual language. Avoid slogans, superlatives, unattributed praise, and long lists of products or services unless they are supported by reliable sources and presented proportionately.\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Business articles should use clear, factual language. Avoid slogans, superlatives, unattributed praise, and long lists of products or services unless they are supported by reliable sources and presented proportionately.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"Structure matters. A well-prepared draft usually includes only the most verifiable and relevant information, with citations placed near the claims they support. Content should reflect what independent sources emphasize, not internal marketing priorities.\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Structure matters. A well-prepared draft usually includes only the most verifiable and relevant information, with citations placed near the claims they support. Content should reflect what independent sources emphasize, not internal marketing priorities.\\\"}]]}]]}]\\n34:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"section\\\",\\\"editing-participation\\\",{\\\"id\\\":\\\"editing-participation\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"mb-10 scroll-mt-28\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-navy md:text-3xl\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Handle company involvement carefully\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-base leading-8 text-muted\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"Employees, founders, agencies, and consultants may have a conflict of interest when editing about a business they represent. Paid-contribution disclosure and transparent participation help reduce risk and maintain trust.\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Employees, founders, agencies, and consultants may have a conflict of interest when editing about a business they represent. Paid-contribution disclosure and transparent participation help reduce risk and maintain trust.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"When involvement creates COI concerns, it may be better to suggest changes with sources, seek feedback, or use an appropriate review process rather than making promotional direct edits. Policy-aware guidance can help determine the safest path.\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"When involvement creates COI concerns, it may be better to suggest changes with sources, seek feedback, or use an appropriate review process rather than making promotional direct edits. Policy-aware guidance can help determine the safest path.\\\"}]]}]]}]\\n35:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"section\\\",null,{\\\"id\\\":\\\"faqs\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"mb-10 scroll-mt-28\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-navy md:text-3xl\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Frequently asked questions\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-5\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L38\\\",null,{\\\"items\\\":[{\\\"q\\\":\\\"Can a business write its own Wikipedia article?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"A business can gather sources and understand the process, but direct involvement can raise conflict-of-interest concerns. Neutrality, reliable sourcing, and transparent handling of paid or connected editing are important considerations.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"What content should a business article include?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"It should include only information supported by reliable independent sources, presented neutrally and proportionately. The exact content depends on what sources cover, not what the business wants to pr\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"omote.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"Do Wikipedia guidelines guarantee approval if followed?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"No. Following guidelines improves quality and compliance, but independent Wikipedia editors make final decisions about content, inclusion, and retention.\\\"}]}]}]]}]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"36:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"section\\\",null,{\\\"id\\\":\\\"references\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"mb-10 scroll-mt-28 rounded-3xl border border-border bg-surface p-6\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-navy\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"References\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-muted\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"External references are provided for general guidance. Wikipedia policies and community practices can change, so review the current source pages before making decisions.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"ul\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-4 space-y-2 text-sm\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"li\\\",\\\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Notability_(organizations_and_companies)\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"a\\\",null,{\\\"href\\\":\\\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Notability_(organizations_and_companies)\\\",\\\"target\\\":\\\"_blank\\\",\\\"rel\\\":\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-electric hover:underline\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Wikipedia: Notability (